WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.468
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:03.903
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.071
And now we're gonna
get to the news.

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:07.907
Russian President Vladimir Putin
is reportedly

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:11.110
expected to formally declare war
this week on Ukraine.

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:13.212
Really? Now?!

00:00:13.212 --> 00:00:15.548
Putin's like the guy who's been
dating the same woman

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:18.217
for six months
but refuses to say "girlfriend."

00:00:18.217 --> 00:00:22.421
Ukraine has its own dresser
drawer in your apartment.

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:24.624
You're at war.

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:27.460
President Biden, last week,
named Karine Jean-Pierre

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.995
as the next White House
press secretary,

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:30.429
which makes her
the first Black woman

00:00:30.429 --> 00:00:32.732
and openly gay person
to hold the position.

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:35.735
So she's going to spend a lot of
time at the podium saying,

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:39.205
"No, I mean,
questions about world events."

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:43.910
The Biden administration issued
a warning over the weekend

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.911
that the country
may see 100 million

00:00:45.911 --> 00:00:48.715
coronavirus infections
this fall and winter unless

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.950
we, as a nation,
commit to going out

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:54.987
and catching it
this summer instead.

00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:56.822
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:00:56.822 --> 00:00:58.758
said, in a new interview,
that the Supreme Court

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:01.294
overturning Roe vs. Wade
could pave the way for

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:02.828
a national ban on abortion.

00:01:02.828 --> 00:01:06.800
On the bright side, Mexico might
finally pay for a wall.

00:01:09.368 --> 00:01:11.804
At a rally held by
former president Trump

00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:14.207
last week, Pennsylvania
Republican Senate candidate

00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:17.276
Dr. Mehmet Oz was
repeatedly booed by the crowd.

00:01:17.276 --> 00:01:21.314
In his defense, that's just how
Pennsylvania says hello.

00:01:23.549 --> 00:01:25.385
The CDC announced
over the weekend

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:28.020
that it's investigating
a recent coronavirus outbreak

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:29.422
on a Carnival Cruise ship.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:32.391
That might be the shortest
investigation ever conducted.

00:01:32.391 --> 00:01:34.293
"It's a cruise ship, you say?

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:37.597
Well, I think we've
figured out your problem."

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:42.835
U2's Bono and The Edge held a
surprise concert yesterday

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:44.404
at a subway station in Ukraine.

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:46.905
If you're curious how it went,
check your iTunes.

00:01:46.905 --> 00:01:48.874
It's already in there.

00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:51.277
They probably didn't think
that decision

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:53.079
would have such a long tail.

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:56.049
Is that a decade --
Is that a decade ago now?

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:57.517
[ Irish accent ] What's the
worst that could happen?

00:01:57.517 --> 00:02:00.787
They're still making jokes
about it 10 years from now?"

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:03.055
[ Normal voice ]
What a good Bono!

00:02:03.055 --> 00:02:04.690
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:06.559
Good Bono.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:10.997
I feel like you
rolled your eyes at me, Wally.

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:15.301
And, finally,
a family in Massachusetts

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.937
recently rescued a puppy
that they found on

00:02:17.937 --> 00:02:20.806
the side of the road, which was
actually a baby coyote.

00:02:20.806 --> 00:02:23.242
Said the family,
"I guess it's for the best.

00:02:23.242 --> 00:02:25.879
It didn't get along with
our cat anyway."

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:30.349
Thanks to the family
who posed for that photo.

00:02:30.349 --> 00:02:31.751
That was the monologue,
everybody.

